        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water of M</strong> is a third-person psychological survival horror game set in a corpse-strewn school. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore twisted classrooms, dark corridors, and hidden underground facilities as you search for the truth behind the mysterious “Water of M.” </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve tense escape room puzzles, evade relentless pursuers, and survive a nightmare where the school is only the surface of something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e78867470d0c3adc3adf209006b44b9d.poster.avif?t=1788591806\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e78867470d0c3adc3adf209006b44b9d.webm?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e78867470d0c3adc3adf209006b44b9d.mp4?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper, you’ll gradually uncover the truth behind the school—perhaps it isn’t a school at all, but a “paranormal research facility.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water of M. Legend says it grants immortality, but here, “obtaining” is never the same as “keeping.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/46570501028d6812ca3e14a7d4d4ad41.poster.avif?t=1788591806\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/46570501028d6812ca3e14a7d4d4ad41.webm?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/46570501028d6812ca3e14a7d4d4ad41.mp4?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your horror experience with toggleable options: turn <strong>Blood &amp; Gore</strong> on/off, or enable the <strong>Retro Filter</strong> for a nostalgic visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A horror story set in a school:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might have lived through it once… but you remember nothing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/1251baa6b41935c46fdded41979480e8.poster.avif?t=1788591806\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/1251baa6b41935c46fdded41979480e8.webm?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/1251baa6b41935c46fdded41979480e8.mp4?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Relentless pursuit:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore in the dark, but beware: something far worse than ghosts is hunting you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past tricks for escaping won’t work here, so watch every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e412622255e293ea9dbb548f7be87ef3.poster.avif?t=1788591806\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e412622255e293ea9dbb548f7be87ef3.webm?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e412622255e293ea9dbb548f7be87ef3.mp4?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Numerous puzzles:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles grow more complex as the game progresses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you might guess the answers — but you won’t be able to guess forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you’ll realize you should have paid more attention to the clues you found earlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>No cheating allowed:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzle solutions are randomized, making guides useless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Pure intensity:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar places become twisted and dangerous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these hallways and classrooms, you’ll be switching between running, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solving puzzles, and fighting — the only chance to catch your breath might come </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from meeting your classmates… or maybe not!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water of M</strong> is a third-person psychological survival horror game set in a corpse-strewn school. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore twisted classrooms, dark corridors, and hidden underground facilities as you search for the truth behind the mysterious “Water of M.” </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve tense escape room puzzles, evade relentless pursuers, and survive a nightmare where the school is only the surface of something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e78867470d0c3adc3adf209006b44b9d.poster.avif?t=1788591806\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e78867470d0c3adc3adf209006b44b9d.webm?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e78867470d0c3adc3adf209006b44b9d.mp4?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper, you’ll gradually uncover the truth behind the school—perhaps it isn’t a school at all, but a “paranormal research facility.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water of M. Legend says it grants immortality, but here, “obtaining” is never the same as “keeping.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/46570501028d6812ca3e14a7d4d4ad41.poster.avif?t=1788591806\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/46570501028d6812ca3e14a7d4d4ad41.webm?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/46570501028d6812ca3e14a7d4d4ad41.mp4?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your horror experience with toggleable options: turn <strong>Blood &amp; Gore</strong> on/off, or enable the <strong>Retro Filter</strong> for a nostalgic visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A horror story set in a school:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might have lived through it once… but you remember nothing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/1251baa6b41935c46fdded41979480e8.poster.avif?t=1788591806\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/1251baa6b41935c46fdded41979480e8.webm?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/1251baa6b41935c46fdded41979480e8.mp4?t=1788591806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Relentless pursuit:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore in the dark, but beware: something far worse than ghosts is hunting you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past tricks for escaping won’t work here, so watch every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e412622255e293ea9dbb548f7be87ef3.poster.avif?t=1788591806\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360340/extras/e412622255